            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>This dataset is compiled as part of Damion Bunders' PhD project on the challenges that gig workers face when organising themselves in a worker-owned and worker-governed cooperative enterprise. It consists of original survey data gathered among the members of four platform cooperatives in Italy that consist of gig workers in the cultural, ICT and education sectors (n = 425).</p>\n\n<p><b>Embargo Reasons:</b> Data includes sensitive data categories, and consent agreement only allows for data to be re-used by other scientists to answer other research questions.</p>"
                }
              }
            ]
